  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of the Whole School Approach for Education for Sustainable Development and Global Citizenship Education in Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Education Sector of the UNESCO Guatemala Office will promote the implementation of the Whole School Approach for Sustainable Development Education and Global Citizenship Education, integrating goal 4.7 of the 2030 Agenda into a strategy to support the strengthening of educational quality.
Guatemala is a multicultural country,   that annually faces natural disasters; where human mobility is critical; and in which gender inequalities are persistent in the education of girls, especially indigenous girls in rural areas. These factors affect access to the right to an equitable, inclusive, and relevant education.</narrative>
  </description>
